[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0010","text":"辛苦了！　今天的排练到此结束\n下次也请多多关照！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0020","text":"好了，我们转移到练习室吧\n明天之前要完成的课题堆积如山呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0030","text":"啊，在那之前……\n之前跟你提过想商量的事，方便吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0040","text":"嗯……\n我也……一直在想那个孩子的事……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0049","text":"小妹妹"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0050","text":"……对了，大家还要继续练习吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0060","text":"我也，想一起去！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0070","text":"我想变得更好……\n想成为宇宙第一……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0080","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0089","text":"小妹妹"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0090","text":"为了这个，我想看L'Antica的练习……\n想多看恋钟姐姐……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0100","text":"……也是呢\n今天时间也不早了，就先让她回去了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0110","text":"能不能想办法挤出些时间……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0120","text":"让她来参观我们的练习\n怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0130","text":"当然得先跟制作人商量\n取得许可才行……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0140","text":"毕竟都说了让她好好看着嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0150","text":"嗯～\n想变得更好的心情我也理解……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0160","text":"三峰赞成"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0170","text":"不错嘛～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0180","text":"我也是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0190","text":"——我没有异议"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_03_0200","text":"嘻嘻～我就知道大家会这么说！\n谢谢你们～！"}]
